ll_id": "toolu_01QD9FGQZkxi5zChd1E7TJEC", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53911, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QD9FGQZkxi5zChd1E7TJEC", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55230, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01XU9HSTdJ5Ko2i8mejwiDAi", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55530, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XU9HSTdJ5Ko2i8mejwiDAi", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55530, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XU9HSTdJ5Ko2i8mejwiDAi", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60249, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc before it were marked unhealthy.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again, and this time it finished in all regions.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now. Health checks are passing and the error rate dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** I opened INC-0001 as a SEV2 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The request timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. The incident had been created, so I didn't retry and there's no duplicate page. The incident summary covers the failed release, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current state.\n\n**Next steps:** someone still needs to find out why v2.3.1 failed, and why the first rollback stopped after us-east.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VBuXNmLyKfzpkLDnz6Vx4J", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01E38QGTK6YDWDa3ayiGghmC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01BdnXRFnKuDBZwHGkkWmA58", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01A81gY9A3UZaE1TJirKD8t4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll try it once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AVDzJYD4nfiS8LDcQW6pzP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CTvz4siRo9qEQ7tvcuoCUQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "too