st, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now. Health checks are passing and the error rate dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** I opened INC-0001 as a SEV2 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The request timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. The incident had been created, so I didn't retry and there's no duplicate page. The incident summary covers the failed release, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current state.\n\n**Next steps:** someone still needs to find out why v2.3.1 failed, and why the first rollback stopped after us-east.", "type": "text"}]}]}